Package: grcthemes
Title: R Markdown HTML Themes by GRC
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gabriela", "Romero Campos", email = "grcampos@ksu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R Markdown HTML output formats with a fixed header, a main menu
    built from level-1 headings, a section-dependent side menu, and a fixed
    footer. Includes callout boxes, code folding, image galleries, high
    resolution download buttons for figures, and matching 'ggplot2' themes,
    colour palettes and scales. Themes: GRC_greenOlive.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/GRCampo/grcthemes
BugReports: https://github.com/GRCampo/grcthemes/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: rmarkdown, knitr, htmltools, ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0), scales, systemfonts, ragg
Suggests: plotly
Collate:
    'themes.R'
    'ggplot.R'
    'format.R'
    'gallery.R'
    'download.R'
    'GRC_greenOlive.R'
    'zzz.R'
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
